{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":1,"count":33,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L02-3-09\",\"睡觉\",\"睡覺\",\"睡觉\",\"V-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"宜文昨天幾點睡覺？","pinyin":"Yíwén zuótiān jǐ diǎn shuìjiào?","english":"What time did Yiwen go to sleep yesterday?","sourceCardId":"B1L02-3-09","sourceFront":"睡覺","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":1},{"chinese":"可是我只想聽音樂、睡覺。","pinyin":"Kěshì wǒ zhǐ xiǎng tīng yīnyuè, shuìjiào.","english":"But I only want to listen to music and sleep.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-01","sourceFront":"電影","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L05-2-19\",\"沙发\",\"沙發\",\"沙发\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"客廳裡面有兩張沙發。","pinyin":"Kètīng lǐmiàn yǒu liǎng zhāng shāfā.","english":"There are two sofas in the living room.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-19","sourceFront":"沙發","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"沙發下面呢？","pinyin":"Shāfā xiàmiàn ne?","english":"How about checking under the sofa?","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-01","sourceFront":"跟","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"沙發上面、下面跟旁邊都沒有。媽，妳幫我找，好嗎？","pinyin":"Shāfā shàngmiàn, xiàmiàn gēn pángbiān dōu méiyǒu. Mā, nǐ bāng wǒ zhǎo, hǎo ma?","english":"It is neither on the sofa, under the sofa, nor beside the sofa. Mom, could you find it for me?","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-01","sourceFront":"跟","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L06-2-09\",\"电脑\",\"電腦\",\"电脑\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我要買一部新電腦。","pinyin":"Wǒ yào mǎi yí bù xīn diànnǎo.","english":"I want to buy a new computer.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-09","sourceFront":"電腦","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我有手機，可是沒有電腦。","pinyin":"Wǒ yǒu shǒujī, kěshì méiyǒu diànnǎo.","english":"I have a cell phone, but I don’t have any computer.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-10","sourceFront":"手機","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"你不要常常在家上網、看電腦、玩手機，應該去運動。明天我有空，我們可以一起去騎腳踏車。","pinyin":"Nǐ búyào chángcháng zài jiā shàngwǎng, kàn diànnǎo, wán shǒujī, yīnggāi qù yùndòng. Míngtiān wǒ yǒukòng, wǒmen kěyǐ yìqǐ qù qí jiǎotàchē.","english":"Don’t surf the internet, use the computer or play on the cell phone at home often. You should go exercise. I am available tomorrow. We can go ride bikes together.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-01","sourceFront":"電影","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L07-3-03\",\"蓝色\",\"藍色\",\"蓝色\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"很好看。這條藍的也很漂亮，藍色是今年很流行的顏色。","pinyin":"Hěn hǎokàn. Zhè tiáo lán de yě hěn piàoliang, lánsè shì jīnnián hěn liúxíng de yánsè.","english":"It is. This pair of blue pants is beautiful too. Blue is a popular color of this year.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-2-01","sourceFront":"黃色","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L09-3-05\",\"練習\",\"練習\",\"练习\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"下個星期華語課有期中考，我有一點兒緊張，所以每天晚上都讀書，也練習寫字，希望下個星期的考試能考得很好。","pinyin":"Xià ge xīngqí Huáyǔ kè yǒu qízhōngkǎo, wǒ yǒu yìdiǎnr jǐnzhāng, suǒyǐ měi tiān wǎnshang dōu dúshū, yě liànxí xiězì, xīwàng xià ge xīngqí de kǎoshì néng kǎo de hěn hǎo.","english":"I will have the midterm exam for Chinese class next week. I am a bit nervous so I study every night and practice writing Chinese characters as well. I hope I can do well on the exam next week.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-3-01","sourceFront":"學期","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這個學期開始，從星期一到星期五我都有華語課，每天從上午八點四十分到中午十二點上課，下午一點寫功課，有時候也跟同學練習說中文。","pinyin":"Zhè ge xuéqí kāishǐ, cóng xīngqí yī dào xīngqí wǔ, wǒ dōu yǒu Huáyǔ kè, měi tiān cóng shàngwǔ bā diǎn sìshí fēn dào zhōngwǔ shí’èr diǎn shàngkè, xiàwǔ yī diǎn xiě gōngkè, yǒushíhou yě gēn tóngxué liànxí shuō Zhōngwén.","english":"This semester I have Chinese class from 8:40 a.m. to 12:00 noon, Mondays to Fridays. I start to do my homework at 1:00 p.m., and sometimes I practice speaking Chinese with my classmates.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-3-01","sourceFront":"學期","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":2}],"wordHook":"練(drill) + 習(study) → drill and study = to practice."},{"key":"[\"B1L11-1-14\",\"還沒\",\"還沒\",\"还没\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"友美說她想去，我還沒決定去不去。燈會好玩嗎？","pinyin":"Yǒuměi shuō tā xiǎng qù, wǒ háiméi juédìng qù bú qù. Dēnghuì hǎowán ma?","english":"Youmei wants to see it. But I haven’t decided to go. Is the Lantern Carnival fun?","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-01","sourceFront":"著","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"還(still) + 沒(not) → still not done, meaning not yet."},{"key":"[\"B1L13-1-06\",\"網址\",\"網址\",\"网址\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這是博物館的網址，你可以先看看。","pinyin":"Zhè shì bówùguǎn de wǎngzhǐ, nǐ kěyǐ xiān kànkan.","english":"This is the museum's web address; you can take a look first.","sourceCardId":"B1L13-1-06","sourceFront":"網址","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":"網(net) + 址(location) → a location on the net: a web address."},{"key":"[\"B1L14-1-12\",\"场\",\"場\",\"场\",\"M\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"從我家到機場也不遠，開車去、坐捷運去都可以。","pinyin":"Cóng wǒ jiā dào jīchǎng yě bù yuǎn, kāichē qù, zuò jiéyùn qù dōu kěyǐ.","english":"It is not far from my house to the airport. I can go by car or MRT.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-3-01","sourceFront":"線","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"機場附近的風景也很漂亮，我常常去看風景、看飛機。","pinyin":"Jīchǎng fùjìn de fēngjǐng yě hěn piàoliang, wǒ chángcháng qù kàn fēngjǐng, kàn fēijī.","english":"The scenery near the airport is beautiful; I often go there to see the view and watch the planes.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-3-01","sourceFront":"線","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"（看地圖）啊！天美飯店在這裡！我知道這個地方，附近有郵局跟超級市場。","pinyin":"(Kàn dìtú) A! Tiānměi Fàndiàn zài zhèlǐ! Wǒ zhīdào zhè ge dìfang, fùjìn yǒu yóujú gēn chāojíshìchǎng.","english":"(Looking at the map) Ah! So here is Tianmei Hotel! I know this place. There is a post office and a supermarket nearby.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-2-01","sourceFront":"路/馬路","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L15-3-07\",\"贏\",\"贏\",\"赢\",\"Vp\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他跑得很快，如果跟他比賽，我沒有機會贏，一定會輸。","pinyin":"Tā pǎo de hěn kuài, rúguǒ gēn tā bǐsài, wǒ méiyǒu jīhuì yíng, yīdìng huì shū.","english":"He runs very fast; if I compete with him, I have no chance of winning—I will definitely lose.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-3-08","sourceFront":"輸","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":2},{"chinese":"他玩遊戲贏了一萬塊錢，真幸運！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-2-15","sourceFront":"幸運","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小安現在的健康情況很差，就算很想參加網球比賽，恐怕也贏不了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-16","sourceFront":"就算","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這場網球比賽打得很激烈，已經打了五個小時了，還不知道誰輸誰贏。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-15","sourceFront":"激烈","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這場籃球比賽我們贏了對方二十分，真是太痛快了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-14","sourceFront":"痛快","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他贏了這次選舉只是運氣好罷了，其實他沒什麼能力。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-01","sourceFront":"罷了","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"她參加這場比賽的唯一目的，就是為了贏得第一名。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-09","sourceFront":"贏得","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"經過多次訓練，他總算贏得這場球賽的冠軍。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-10","sourceFront":"冠軍","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這場棒球比賽已打到最後一局，可是仍無法看出誰輸誰贏。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-48","sourceFront":"局","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"a 吂(speechless) runner by the 月(moon) takes 貝(sea shell) coin as 卂(fly rapidly) flags hail the 贏(win)."},{"key":"[\"B2L01-2-14\",\"拉\",\"拉\",\"拉\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那三個孩子手拉著手，一起去公園玩。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-2-14","sourceFront":"拉","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我吃了不乾淨的東西，今天就拉了三次肚子了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-03","sourceFront":"拉肚子","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有的人一喝牛奶就拉肚子，可能是因為身體吸收不料牛奶的營養。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-25","sourceFront":"吸收","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L04-1-17\",\"习惯\",\"習慣\",\"习惯\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他習慣睡覺以前聽一點兒音樂。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-1-17","sourceFront":"習慣","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"張先生不但飲食習慣很好，而且每天運動，所以身體很健康。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-34","sourceFront":"飲食","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每個民族都有自己特殊的風俗習慣，有時候外國人不容易了解。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-1-17","sourceFront":"風俗","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我室友的生活習慣很差，我已經忍耐他很久了，真希望他馬上搬走。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-41","sourceFront":"忍耐","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"現在大家都習慣用手機照相，一般的相機已經越來越少人使用了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-1-13","sourceFront":"使用","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"室友老是把髒襪子扔在地上，希望他能把這個壞習慣改掉。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-25","sourceFront":"扔","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"何小姐習慣去傳統市場買水果，而且都跟同一個攤販買。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-07","sourceFront":"攤販","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"照華人的傳統習慣，女人生完孩子就要坐月子，一直在家休息到孩子滿月。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-01","sourceFront":"坐月子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我記得第一次出國讀書時，因為不習慣和家人分開，常常半夜哭著打電話回家","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-36","sourceFront":"分開","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我跟弟弟是雙胞胎，很多人都以為我是他，這樣的誤會我早就習慣了","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-06","sourceFront":"誤會","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小游經常喝了酒還開車回家，太太警告他如果不改掉這個壞習慣，就要跟他離婚。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-20","sourceFront":"警告","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"簡老闆因為生意的關係，經常接觸越南人，相當了解兩國之間工作習慣的差異。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-12","sourceFront":"接觸","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"何先生早就習慣了單身生活，一點都不想結婚。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-25","sourceFront":"單身","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"想要讓身體健康，得先注意飲食，少吃太油、太鹹的食物；其次要培養每天運動的好習慣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-19","sourceFront":"其次","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"中國南北方的飲食習慣有一些差異，南方人多吃米飯，北方人多吃餃子、饅頭等麵食。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-15","sourceFront":"米飯","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我習慣來這家銀行存款，因為這裡的員工都十分親切。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-26","sourceFront":"存款","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"送禮品給外國朋友前，最好先了解不同國家的送禮習慣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-21","sourceFront":"禮品","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我爺爺習慣吃中式早餐，每天早上都是吃包子配豆漿。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-36","sourceFront":"中式","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我每天騎車上班前，總是習慣先檢查摩托車的輪子正不正常。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-14","sourceFront":"輪子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"自從他改變飲食習慣以後，就變得既健康又有活力。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-30","sourceFront":"活力","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我跟他的個性、想法都合得來，就是飲食習慣合不來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-49","sourceFront":"合不來","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"奶奶養了幾隻雞，每天早上習慣抓兩把玉米餵牠們。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-27","sourceFront":"把","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有些女性懷孕時飲食習慣會有極大的改變，醫生說這是正常現象。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-11","sourceFront":"懷孕","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我習慣把每一筆支出都記錄起來，提醒自己少花點兒錢。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-17","sourceFront":"支出","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"隨著電子產業發展，人們的生活習慣也受到很深的影響。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-06","sourceFront":"產業","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我在喝粥時習慣加一些芝麻進去，喝起來很香。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-35","sourceFront":"芝麻","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"世界各地的神話雖然不見得都真實，卻能讓人們多少了解一些古代的風俗習慣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-01","sourceFront":"神話","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"由於網路發達，現代人大都習慣上網購物。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-14","sourceFront":"大都","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我習慣在家裡放一盆花，讓室內有鮮花的香味。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-33","sourceFront":"盆","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"手機鬧鐘的音量及音樂聲，都可按照個人的使用習慣來調整。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-35","sourceFront":"音量","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L05-1-30\",\"紅綠燈\",\"紅綠燈\",\"红绿灯\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"路上安裝紅綠燈，是要保障民眾的交通安全。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-13","sourceFront":"保障","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L06-1-09\",\"地板\",\"地板\",\"地板\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"隔壁的人在跳舞，我房間的地板也動了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-1-10","sourceFront":"動","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"姊姊覺得木頭地板很麻煩，因為得跪著擦才擦得乾淨。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-44","sourceFront":"跪","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你去書房把地板拖乾淨，好放我新買的地毯。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-10","sourceFront":"拖","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L09-1-06\",\"門\",\"門\",\"门\",\"M\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"弟弟在門後面。","pinyin":"Dìdi zài mén hòumiàn.","english":"My younger brother is behind the door.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-3-06","sourceFront":"門","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"Two tall panels swing apart on hinges to reveal a 門(door)."},{"key":"[\"B2L09-1-24\",\"认真\",\"認真\",\"认真\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他上課的時候很認真，所以功課一直很好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-1-24","sourceFront":"認真","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"經理做事態度認真、負責，我從他身上學到了很多做人做事的道理。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-11","sourceFront":"身上","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"任何人都應該認真思考自己的未來，別糊里糊塗地過日子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-09","sourceFront":"思考","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"黃教授不僅知識豐富、上課認真，還很關心學生，大家都很尊敬他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-22","sourceFront":"尊敬","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了提高英文程度，我除了認真上課、寫作業，還每天聽收音機的英文廣播。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-40","sourceFront":"提高","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"就我對小林的了解，他是一個很實在的人，不但做事認真，說話也不誇張。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-09","sourceFront":"就","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"林同學上課很專心，也很認真地把老師教的寫下來，這樣回家就能複習了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-19","sourceFront":"專心","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"黃先生上班常遲到，也不認真工作，這樣的態度讓老闆很不滿。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-21","sourceFront":"不滿","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小馬做事又負責又認真，答應別人的事情也一定會做到，是個很可靠的人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-26","sourceFront":"可靠","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"結婚之前，那對情侶認真規劃了未來的生活，沒想到結婚一個月之後就離婚了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-25","sourceFront":"之前","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"張老師認真觀察學生們的表現，這樣才能了解他們的心理和學習情況。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-23","sourceFront":"觀察","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L12-1-01\",\"職員\",\"職員\",\"职员\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我以為張先生是那家公司的大老闆，其實他只是個小職員。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-1-01","sourceFront":"職員","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"那家貿易公司跟美國做生意，職員都得會說英文。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-1-21","sourceFront":"貿易","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"在那家公司上班的職員，都要穿襯衫、長褲。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-2-06","sourceFront":"襯衫","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3}