"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-06","sourceFront":"反而","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有關這場火災的詳細情況，等調查結果出來以後，市長會向民眾報告。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-31","sourceFront":"有關","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那棟公寓自從三年前的一場大火之後，就不適合居住了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-19","sourceFront":"居住","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家醫院昨天半夜發生嚴重的火災，受傷的人數約有三十名。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-21","sourceFront":"人數","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"週末的時候，火車站的賣票窗口總是排滿了人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-32","sourceFront":"窗口","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在臺灣，退火車票得早一點兒，越晚退的話，扣的錢也越多。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-46","sourceFront":"退","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在臺灣，上網訂好火車票後，可選擇到車站或便利商店取票。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-21","sourceFront":"取","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"火鍋(hotpot)剛煮好時很燙，吃的時候小心點兒。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-23","sourceFront":"燙","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"露營最開心的就是當營火(campfire)燃燒時，大家在營火周圍又唱又跳。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-41","sourceFront":"燃燒","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"坐火車時，一旁的旅客不停地講電話，吵得我受不了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-43","sourceFront":"一旁","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"火腿裡放了很多鹽巴，醫師不建議爺爺多吃。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-13","sourceFront":"火腿","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"總統在廣場點燃煙火，跟民眾一起慶祝新年。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-28","sourceFront":"點燃","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"八(eight) sparks rest around a 人(person) → the blaze of 火(fire)."},{"key":"[\"B3L05-2-02\",\"島\",\"島\",\"岛\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"臺灣是一個海島國家，周圍的海底有豐富的珍貴資源。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-02","sourceFront":"島","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我本來打算下星期騎車環島，但是颱風剛過，想來想去，還是決定不去了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-04","sourceFront":"環島","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"公司很重視員工的身心健康，每年都安排一連五天的環島旅行，家人也可以參加。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-19","sourceFront":"身心","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"臺灣是一個南北長約三百八十公里的海島，約有兩千三百五十萬人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-13","sourceFront":"約","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"能不能騎自行車完成環島的行程，跟耐心有關，跟聰明不聰明無關。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-09","sourceFront":"有關","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這座島的風景很美，旅館價格也很合理，難怪不少遊客年年都來這裡旅行。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-26","sourceFront":"年年","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"春假時我打算到泰國小島上的鄉村去度個假。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-19","sourceFront":"度","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"A 山(mountain) rising straight out of the sea is land surrounded by water: an 島(island)."},{"key":"[\"B3L08-1-06\",\"誤會\",\"誤會\",\"误会\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我跟弟弟是雙胞胎，很多人都以為我是他，這樣的誤會我早就習慣了","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-06","sourceFront":"誤會","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"A:何小姐只是我的鄰居，不是我的女朋友，大家都誤會了。 B:你對她很體貼，不但常送她上班，還常陪她逛街，大家對你們有誤會也是正常的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-06","sourceFront":"誤會","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"青少年常因為不了解而誤會父母的教育方式，或許等他們長大了，就能真正明白了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-24","sourceFront":"真正","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"你們之間的誤會越來越深，要是不面對面說清楚，恐怕連朋友都當不成了","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-11","sourceFront":"對","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他最近對你說話的態度變得冷淡，你們之間是不是有什麼誤會？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-18","sourceFront":"冷淡","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"由於每個人看事情的角度不同，所以得溝通才能避免誤會","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-10","sourceFront":"角度","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"前幾天他們因為一點兒小誤會吵了一架，還好現在和好了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-13","sourceFront":"和好","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"別人對你有誤會的時候用不著生氣，解釋清楚就好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-48","sourceFront":"用不著","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"知道自己誤會別人以後，最好早一點兒跟對方道歉。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-2-14","sourceFront":"誤會","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 誤(error) and 會(meet): 誤會 means misunderstanding."},{"key":"[\"B4L02-1-12\",\"按\",\"按\",\"按\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這種鬧鐘有點特別，響了以後得按三下才能關掉。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-12","sourceFront":"按","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"飲食與健康有密切的關係，所以人人都應該按時吃三餐。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-19","sourceFront":"密切","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"按照華人的習俗，紅包裡面的錢不可以是四百、四千等等。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-04","sourceFront":"按照","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"護理師告訴病人，得按三餐飯後的時間吃藥，才能快點恢復健康。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-20","sourceFront":"按","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"按照商品目錄的說明，消費滿五百元可以打八五折。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-24","sourceFront":"目錄","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"完全按照別人的話來工作，是很省事沒錯，卻失去了讓自己進步的機會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-42","sourceFront":"省事","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"除非別人願意，否則你不該強迫其他人全按你的意見做事。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-45","sourceFront":"強迫","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果你亂吃垃圾食品，就算按時運動，體重也很難減輕。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-17","sourceFront":"按時","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"按照中國的傳統觀念，女人未嫁時得聽父親的話，嫁了人之後就得聽丈夫的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-43","sourceFront":"丈夫","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"按照我國官方規定，民間辦理環保活動可向官方申請經費。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-03","sourceFront":"官方","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"手機鬧鐘的音量及音樂聲，都可按照個人的使用習慣來調整。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-35","sourceFront":"音量","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Pressing down with a steady 扌(hand) to maintain a 安(peaceful) balance follows strict protocol: 按(based on)."},{"key":"[\"B4L07-1-23\",\"四季\",\"四季\",\"四季\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我國四季都有美麗的風景：春季時平原有花海、夏季時海灘有日出、秋季時山區有紅樹、冬季時高山有白雪，都十分迷人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-23","sourceFront":"四季","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"觀光客都說日本四季的景色都很有特色，有機會我要親自去體驗一下。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-32","sourceFront":"體驗","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L07-2-10\",\"時時\",\"時時\",\"时时\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"天氣不穩定的時候，氣溫也時時跟著變化(to change,to vary)。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-2-10","sourceFront":"時時","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L07-2-15\",\"只是\",\"只是\",\"只是\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我看著你只是想告訴你，你的臉上黏了東西。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-2-15","sourceFront":"只是","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他說的話都很有道理，不是廢話，只是你聽不進去而已。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-44","sourceFront":"廢話","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"在真實世界中沒有「龍」這種動物，那只是古人的想像。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-03","sourceFront":"想像","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"人人都喜歡薪水高、離家近、輕鬆的工作，不過這往往只是一個夢。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-29","sourceFront":"薪水","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"經理找你談話，只是單純地想了解你對新工作適不適應，你別緊張。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-13","sourceFront":"單純","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"A:何小姐只是我的鄰居，不是我的女朋友，大家都誤會了。 B:你對她很體貼，不但常送她上班，還常陪她逛街，大家對你們有誤會也是正常的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-06","sourceFront":"誤會","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我一直想到歐洲去旅行，只是現在忙得沒時間去，希望明年能夢想成真。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-33","sourceFront":"只是","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我以為張先生是那家公司的大老闆，其實他只是個小職員。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-1-01","sourceFront":"職員","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"伯父的孩子是對雙胞胎，不只是樣子，連說話的聲音都像。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-20","sourceFront":"伯父","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他只是開個小玩笑而已，你何必那麼在乎呢？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-2-06","sourceFront":"何必","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個背包在設計上沒什麼特色，只是印了某位明星隨手畫的圖，沒想到就要賣上萬元，實在有點兒誇張。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-30","sourceFront":"印","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他贏了這次選舉只是運氣好罷了，其實他沒什麼能力。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-01","sourceFront":"罷了","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"水和冰基本上是相同的，只是因溫度而產生不同的變化。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-19","sourceFront":"基本上","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 只(only) and 是(be): 只是 means but then."},{"key":"[\"B4L11-1-01\",\"喜事\",\"喜事\",\"喜事\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"王伯伯為兒子辦喜事，擺了五十桌喜酒，熱鬧極了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-35","sourceFront":"桌","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我好友都已結婚了，什麼時候才換我辦喜事，請大家喝喜酒？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-02","sourceFront":"喜酒","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L12-2-11\",\"本來\",\"本來\",\"本来\",\"Vs-attr\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"用人類的角度去看大自然， 就看不出大自然的本來價值。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-11","sourceFront":"本來","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他本來是一滴酒都不碰的人，你就別再叫他喝了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-09","sourceFront":"滴","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"教授的房間堆滿了各種書籍，本來就不大的房間感覺更擠了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-25","sourceFront":"堆","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"A:要不是你幫忙，現在我還找不到工作呢！ B:沒什麼，朋友之間本來就應該互相幫助。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-05","sourceFront":"之間","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這家電腦公司本來只服務亞洲地區的民眾，現在服務範圍已經擴大到歐洲了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-28","sourceFront":"範圍","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"小畢本來認為自己的書法寫得很好，但是上次比賽輸了以後，他就失去自信了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-14","sourceFront":"自信","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我本來打算下星期騎車環島，但是颱風剛過，想來想去，還是決定不去了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-04","sourceFront":"環島","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"颱風快來了，破壞了我本來要去露營的計畫。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-20","sourceFront":"破壞","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我爸爸本來在車站旁邊有一塊地，後來他把那塊地賣了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-1-24","sourceFront":"地","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我今天本來想去看電影，後來下雨就沒去了。","pinyin":"Wǒ jīntiān běnlái xiǎng qù kàn diànyǐng, hòulái xià yǔ jiù méi qù le.","english":"Today I originally wanted to go see a movie, but later it rained so I didn't go.","sourceCardId":"B1L16-2-02","sourceFront":"後來","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"本(root) + 來(come) → the root from which it comes means 'originally'."},{"key":"[\"B4L12-2-20\",\"性别\",\"性別\",\"性别\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"人的性格主要是受成長環境的影響，跟性別沒有太大的關係。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-20","sourceFront":"性別","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"對任何人的態度，不該因種族、國籍或性別而不同。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-27","sourceFront":"國籍","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L14-2-01\",\"神话\",\"神話\",\"神话\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"世界各地的神話雖然不見得都真實，卻能讓人們多少了解一些古代的風俗習慣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-01","sourceFront":"神話","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"傳說月亮上住著一隻兔子，這個神話留給孩子們許多想像空間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-04","sourceFront":"傳說","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"別的\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"別(other) + 的(possessive) → some other one: 別的(other; else)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"同事\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"同(same) + 事(affair) → people who share the same work affairs: colleague."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"燭\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A flickering 火(fire) flame burning on a wick: 燭(candle)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"班\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 王(jade) token stamps every seat in the row → one 班(class)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"白菜\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 白(for nothing) and 菜(vegetables): 白菜 means Chinese cabbage."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"短\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A full-length 矢(arrow) lies beside a 豆(beans) sprout → the beanstalk stays 短(short)."}]}
